{"unit_id": "tag:08X9:statement", "translation": "若<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>中的一个分裂单射（split injection），则可以通过直接分裂（splitting）<MATH_0003>来简化论证，无需使用<MATH_0004>。若<MATH_0005>忠实平坦（faithfully flat），事情就更简单；此时，引理<REF_0001>的结论直接成立，因为在<MATH_0006>上与<MATH_0007>作张量积（tensoring）保持所有等化子（equalizers）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "split injection", "target_term": "分裂单射"}, {"source_term": "splitting", "target_term": "分裂"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦"}, {"source_term": "tensoring", "target_term": "作张量积"}, {"source_term": "equalizers", "target_term": "等化子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "split injection", "target_term": "分裂单射", "context": "给定映射的性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "splitting", "target_term": "分裂", "context": "直接分裂操作，待决。"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦", "context": "较易情形，待决。"}, {"source_term": "tensoring", "target_term": "作张量积", "context": "张量函子保持等化子，待决。"}, {"source_term": "equalizers", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "所保持的极限，待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:08XA:statement", "translation": "以下条件等价（equivalent）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(a)<ITEMCLOSE_0001> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>是模（modules）的下降（descent）态射（morphism）。\n<ITEMOPEN_0002>(b)<ITEMCLOSE_0002> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>是模（modules）的有效的（effective）下降（descent）态射（morphism）。\n<ITEMOPEN_0003>(c)<ITEMCLOSE_0003> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>普遍（universally）为单射（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0002>\n", "allowed_english": ["a", "b", "c"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效的"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universally", "target_term": "普遍"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "三个条件，待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定态射及下降态射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "下降对象，待决。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降态射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效的", "context": "模的有效下降态射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "universally", "target_term": "普遍", "context": "任意基扩张下的单射性，待决。"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "环映射性质，待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:08XA:proof", "translation": "显然（b）蕴涵（a）。现在验证（a）蕴涵（c）。若<MATH_0001>并非普遍（universally）为单射（injective），则可以找到<MATH_0002>，使映射（map）<MATH_0003>有非平凡的核（kernel）<MATH_0004>。自然投影（projection）<MATH_0005>并非同构（isomorphism），但它在<MATH_0006>中的像（image）是同构（isomorphism）。因此，<MATH_0007>并非完全忠实的（fully faithful）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n最后验证（c）蕴涵（b）。由引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>，对<MATH_0008>，自然的映射（map）<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>-模（modules）的同构（isomorphism）。对<MATH_0011>，我们要证明<MATH_0012>是同构（isomorphism）。由伴随关系（adjunction），复合（composition）<MATH_0013>是恒等（identity），而上述结论表明第二条箭头是同构（isomorphism）。因此<MATH_0014>是同构（isomorphism）。由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0003>，我们得出<MATH_0015>是同构（isomorphism）。从而<MATH_0016>和<MATH_0017>是互为拟逆（quasi-inverse）的函子（functors），证明了所述结论。\n", "allowed_english": ["a", "b", "c"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universally", "target_term": "普遍"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "projection", "target_term": "投影"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实的"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "adjunction", "target_term": "伴随关系"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "identity", "target_term": "恒等"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "quasi-inverse", "target_term": "拟逆"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "universally", "target_term": "普遍", "conte